Subject: [PATCH 107/149] nr: live compare windows (--nr_compare_dump_dir, F10
 bind, frame-end hook, EDRAM snapshot to observer); off by default

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit 588cccbd39b8f5a5edd044730aff65b96e456c3a)
